# ArduPlane Parameters - Mini Talon Airspeed Overlay (envelope cell: scaled18_28)
# Apply on top of plane_base.parm for Gazebo wind / pitot worlds.
#
# Envelope Sensitivity Matrix cell (ADR-0012, ADR-0013): BOTH-SCALED.
# Identical to config/overlays/plane_airspeed.parm EXCEPT AIRSPEED_CRUISE and
# AIRSPEED_MAX. The pair 18/28 preserves the baseline max/cruise margin
# (28/18 = 1.556 vs. baseline 22/14 = 1.571), so comparing this cell against the
# 14/22 baseline separates absolute-speed effects from envelope-margin effects.
# AIRSPEED_MIN held at baseline 10.
#
# Shares the MAX=28 untested-regime caveat with plane_airspeed_max28.parm; the
# 14/28 flyability smoke covers the high-ceiling concern (ADR-0012).
#
# One-source rule:
# - Gazebo provides wind
# - SITL wind remains disabled

ARSPD_TYPE       100       # JSON airspeed sensor from Gazebo / ArduPilotPlugin
ARSPD_USE        1
ARSPD_AUTOCAL    0         # Do not learn offset from live wind on startup
ARSPD_SKIP_CAL   1         # Keep startup from zeroing in active wind
ARSPD_OFFSET     0

# Both-scaled envelope cell: cruise 18, ceiling 28 (margin preserved ~1.56).
AIRSPEED_CRUISE  18
AIRSPEED_MIN     10
AIRSPEED_MAX     28
STALL_PREVENTION 1

SIM_WIND_SPD     0
SIM_WIND_DIR     180
SIM_WIND_TURB    0
AHRS_WIND_MAX    15
